      * RPG IV: numeric constants continued on the next line (FREE-64, RV-57)
     DNUMERIC          C                   12345
     D                                     67
     DRATE             C                   3.14
     D                                     159
     DBIG              S             15  0 INZ(12345678
     D                                     9012345)
     C                   EVAL      BIG = NUMERIC
